{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>You shall not commit adultery.</b> Its essence concerns a married woman, that being the most common transgression among those who sin. Included under it is every forbidden sexual relations." "<b>You shall not steal.</b> Included under theft are kidnapping, theft of money, and deception of people — even though the essence of the prohibition concerns kidnapping, a matter derived from its context, as the Sages of blessed memory derived it (Sanhedrin 86a)." "<b>You shall not bear false witness against your fellow.</b> Included under this are going about as a talebearer and spreading evil report, even though its essence concerns one who testifies in court."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:26:30.490279606Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}